`benchmark.meta description: Builds a 20,000-chat archive of about 9 KB of Zipf-distributed text per chat, then times full-text search: a rare word, a common word, one- and two-letter prefixes, three words, a second page, and typing a word with all three places searched per keystroke, in one grouped call and in one call per place.
`benchmark.meta timing: not-recommended
`benchmark.meta profiles: chat-search

/ai/bench/fixtures/chat-search-bench-fixture

. times = run-chat-search-bench(20000)
